WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:06.850
<i>If I am to devote my life to someone,
I will surpass my limitation.</i>

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:12.340
<i>Now and here,
I will become my own strength.</i>

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:16.490
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:25.600
<i>There are places I like to forget.
There are memories I like to forget.</i>

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:31.950
<i>I can't get rid of this swirling hesitation...
and my pride is wounded.</i>

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.080
<i>The light is covered in dust,
if you see through the darkness...</i>

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:44.500
<i>You can find your path to the new door.</i>

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:50.730
<i>Beautiful sword dances like the wind.</i>

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:57.650
<i>Fate so strong, it creates miracles in my life.</i>

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:00.220
<i>Flower of Bravery.</i>

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:07.100
<i>Looking only for the truth.
I noticed you were there beside me.</i>

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:12.820
<i>Your special soul will be our bond.</i>

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:19.550
<i>A sadness I can't break free reflects in the depths of my memory.</i>

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:24.850
<i>Now and here, my sadness will be my strength.</i>

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:27.520
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:01.450
A dream again?

00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:06.980
Rin Rin, I had a bad dream again thanks to you...huh?

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:19.880
I guess I'll go wash my face.

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:41.020
Stop it!

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:42.580
What?  A woman?

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:45.190
Are you also part of the Volunteer Army?

00:02:45.230 --> 00:02:45.920
Uh, no.

00:02:46.030 --> 00:02:47.350
Prepare to die!

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:55.450
What's going on, Kan'u? It's so noisy.

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:58.680
Koumei, get back inside!  Wake Rin Rin up.

00:02:59.060 --> 00:03:01.150
And get my Green Dragon Crescent Blade!

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:02.330
Y... yes!

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:10.120
Damn it.

00:03:17.010 --> 00:03:17.530
Rin Rin.

00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:20.970
Kan'u!

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:24.830
Thanks.

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:26.710
Damn you.

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:31.650
I don't know what's going on.  But since things have turned out like this, let's give them hell.

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:32.650
I got it!

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:01.340
Who the heck are these guys?

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:05.550
No matter how many lives we have, it won't be enough to fight them!

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:10.450
Hey, what are you doing?

00:04:11.740 --> 00:04:15.000
The enemy has retreated. After them!

00:04:15.210 --> 00:04:16.530
Yes, sir.

00:04:17.370 --> 00:04:22.380
<b>Kan’u Encounters Ryuubi</b>

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:24.460
Ah, good.

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:32.420
I don't know who you are or where you came from, but thanks for your help.

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:38.060
I am Ryuubi Gentoku, the captain of this Volunteer Army.

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:40.490
I am pleased to meet you.

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:44.070
My name is Kan'u Unchō.

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:46.650
This is my adopted sister, Chōhi.

00:04:46.990 --> 00:04:48.420
And this is…

00:04:48.590 --> 00:04:50.120
My name is Koumei.

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:55.650
I see, Kan’u, Chōhi and Koumei.

00:04:57.880 --> 00:04:58.610
Oh?

00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:01.980
That skill and that hair…

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:05.210
Could you be the Black Hair Bandit Hunter?

00:05:05.420 --> 00:05:08.690
Well, kind of…

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:10.920
So, I was right.

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:15.370
You are as beautiful as the rumors said.

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:14.360
<i>Even though I am not a rare beauty…</i>

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:18.040
What did you just say?

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:22.320
I said you are as beautiful as you were rumored to be.

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:28.130
Well, thank you.

00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:31.140
<b>Touka village</b>

00:05:36.990 --> 00:05:39.460
What happened, Mr. Captain of the Volunteer Army?

00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:42.040
It looks like you’ve returned victorious?

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:44.540
<i>We have </i>returned victorious.

00:05:44.890 --> 00:05:48.960
Ah, I see, I see.  So you have returned victorious.

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:50.000
WHAT?!

00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:57.440
I really have lived a long life, to see Ryuubi return with a victory!

00:05:59.000 --> 00:05:59.940
Honorable village Chief…

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:05.610
Umm, has Ryuubi’s Volunteer Army been defeated that often?

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:09.820
Well, ... yes.

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:17.330
Ryuubi came to Touka village just three months ago with a small army.

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:23.240
At first we thought they were bankrupt bandits, because of their suspicious appearance.

00:06:23.310 --> 00:06:29.360
But after hearing his story, I learned that he is nobility, a descendant of Prince Jing of Zhongshan.

00:06:31.170 --> 00:06:33.710
<i>Oh, a Volunteer Army?</i>

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:38.470
<i>Yes. There are fierce bands of bandits running rampant.</i>

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:44.280
<i>We have raised an army to punish them and bring peace to the citizens.</i>

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:49.070
<i>We heard that the village chief, here was an honorable and righteous man.</i>

00:06:49.530 --> 00:06:54.250
<i>Even though we have the will, we don’t have enough food, let alone weapons.</i>

00:06:55.050 --> 00:06:59.890
<i>I am asking you to help, for the sake of all the people in the land.</i>

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:07.880
That’s how it all started. We supplied them with food and weapons to take to battle.

00:07:08.060 --> 00:07:09.800
However…

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:14.670
He ended up losing all seven battles.

00:07:14.770 --> 00:07:19.740
We decided to kick them out of the village if they lose again.

00:07:19.780 --> 00:07:22.180
Well, we should let bygones be bygones.

00:07:22.730 --> 00:07:26.450
Anyways, we did win this time.

00:07:26.970 --> 00:07:30.690
Kan’u, as you heard, we have been embarrassed many times.

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:37.160
Would you please lend me your strength, in order to defeat these bandits and restore peace to our land?

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:49.370
Ryuubi, huh?

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:54.160
In some ways, he reminds me of my brother.

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:57.710
<i>You are as beautiful as the rumors said.</i>

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:14.230
<i>Alright.  First, we send a small unit to provoke the bandits hiding in the fortress.</i>

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:18.750
<i>After the bandits leave their fortress, we engage them in battle for a little while.</i>

00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:22.330
<i>Then order the decoy unit to retreat.</i>

00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:27.370
Retreat!

00:08:27.680 --> 00:08:29.460
Retreat!

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:39.190
Men, let’s beat the hell out of these Volunteer Army wimps!

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:46.740
<i>Then lure the bandits to this valley.</i>

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:52.130
What?

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:55.190
Damn it!

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:56.160
What is this?

00:08:57.830 --> 00:08:59.500
It’s a trap.

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:04.710
You bandits who take advantage of these chaotic times to torment innocent people…

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:07.040
You will meet your fate here!

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:10.420
I’m going to beat you all up to a pulp!

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:23.770
<i>After the enemy reaches to the middle of this valley. Kan’u’s and Rin Rin’s units…</i>

00:09:25.190 --> 00:09:29.510
<i>Which have been hiding on either sides of the valley, will attack simultaneously!</i>

00:09:32.980 --> 00:09:36.500
<i>Damn the Volunteer Army for playing such a dirty trick.</i>

00:09:36.560 --> 00:09:38.270
<i>Once I return to the fort...</i>

00:09:42.020 --> 00:09:43.690
Hey, open the gates!

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:50.580
You’re a bit too late.

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:54.050
This fortress is in the hands of the Volunteer Army now.

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:36.820
Ever since Kan’u and the others joined the Volunteer Army, we’ve been victorious in every battle.

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:39.430
This territory, and its surrounding area has been totally appeased.

00:10:39.810 --> 00:10:46.560
The bravery of Kan’u and the others cannot be denied, but I’ve been impressed by Koumei’s tactical mind.

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:50.560
You are not in the least inferior to the famous tactician Chouryou…

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:53.930
Who helped Emperor Ryuuhou of the Han Dynasty conquer the whole country!

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:57.020
I am not any kind of great tactician.

00:10:57.090 --> 00:11:00.990
I just gave a little advice to everyone.

00:11:01.060 --> 00:11:02.000
That’s right.

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:09.790
With me and Aisha here, there is no need for a complicated plan.

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:13.650
Wiping out bandits is as easy as pie.

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:16.910
As expected from a brave warrior like Chōhi!

00:11:23.830 --> 00:11:24.740
Kan’u.

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:30.650
Ryuubi.

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.070
What’s the matter?

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:34.610
Is there something wrong with the feast?

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:39.450
Oh, no, it’s just that the moon is so beautiful.

00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:40.660
The moon?

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:44.490
Oh, you are right, it is beautiful.

00:11:44.900 --> 00:11:49.840
But it’s no match for your beauty.

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:52.450
W... what are you saying?

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:54.950
You shouldn’t make fun of me.

00:11:55.510 --> 00:11:56.270
Kan’u.

00:11:56.590 --> 00:11:57.210
Yes.

00:11:57.600 --> 00:12:01.070
This might surprise you to hear, so suddenly out of nowhere but...

00:12:01.350 --> 00:12:04.760
Will you stay with me forever?

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:08.760
What?  D... does that mean?!

00:12:09.570 --> 00:12:14.320
I don’t believe someone like me is worthy of being a master to a heroine like you.

00:12:14.530 --> 00:12:17.240
But I don’t plan to stay like this forever.

00:12:17.660 --> 00:12:21.690
I want to improve my reputation by annihilating bandits and recruiting more soldiers.

00:12:21.830 --> 00:12:24.580
I plan to establish myself as a reputable commander.

00:12:25.030 --> 00:12:28.440
For that I need your strength.

00:12:30.490 --> 00:12:33.170
So that’s what you mean by wanting to be with me…

00:12:33.340 --> 00:12:36.850
So, how about it, Kan’u?  Would you be my subordinate?

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:39.360
Eh, well, about that…

00:12:39.670 --> 00:12:42.730
Oh you accept?

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:44.050
Uh, nah…

00:12:44.220 --> 00:12:46.830
So, this is where you were!

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:52.360
There’s not much left; you better hurry up and get some.

00:12:56.220 --> 00:12:58.480
What are you doing?

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:21.010
Koumei, haven’t we picked enough medicinal herbs?

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:23.860
Yes.  Just a little more.

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:26.960
But the sun is setting.

00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:30.710
I’m sorry, just a few more, please.

00:13:30.820 --> 00:13:34.190
Since we’ve been fighting constantly, the number of injured men has increased.

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:37.630
I want to stock up as many medicinal herbs as I can.

00:13:41.530 --> 00:13:42.460
What’s the matter?

00:13:42.600 --> 00:13:43.580
Please look at this.

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:48.970
This is called the Three-day plant. It’s very effective for lowering a fever.

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:51.920
The flower has such an unusual appearance.

00:13:52.170 --> 00:13:57.520
It feeds off the dead animal's body. It buds on the first day, and grows leaves on the second day…

00:13:57.620 --> 00:14:01.340
On the third day it flowers. That’s why it’s called the Three-day plant.

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:06.730
On the fourth day, it withers away. It’s a rare and valuable find.

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:36.640
But still Bachō, what caused you to pass out on the side of the road?

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:42.620
I can’t understand a word you’re saying.

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:52.940
What I said was I ran out of money while I was training.

00:14:53.010 --> 00:14:54.820
I was desperate and starving.

00:14:55.240 --> 00:15:00.280
Then, I remembered how that gluttonous midget Kyocho picked edible herbs and plants on the mountain.

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:05.150
I tried the same, but I couldn’t figure out which ones were edible.

00:15:05.430 --> 00:15:09.320
So I picked some wild mushrooms, grilled them and ate them.

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:12.000
In a sense, I hit the jackpot.

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:14.890
Soon after eating them, the world started to spin around and around.

00:15:15.020 --> 00:15:21.040
After a while, I saw a mouse with huge ears and noisy ducks that wouldn’t shut up.

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:27.400
Before I knew it, I was running all over the mountain with them. Laughing all through the night.

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:32.440
After that, I used up all my energy and hit the ground like a rock.

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:38.110
I think Bachō probably ate a psychedelic mushroom.

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:43.150
This caused her to hallucinate.  Someone with ordinary nerves would probably have laughed themselves to death.

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:48.610
Well, she definitely doesn’t have ordinary nerves!

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:56.990
I have to pee.

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:04.220
Where’s the bathroom?

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:07.490
I’ll pee on myself, if I don’t find it soon.

00:16:23.110 --> 00:16:26.370
W…W…We’re under attack!

00:16:29.160 --> 00:16:30.200
Everyone wake up!

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:35.070
Enemy attack!  Enemy attack!   
Enemy attack! Enemy attack!  Hey, wake up!

00:16:39.270 --> 00:16:41.740
It’s not that funny.

00:16:41.920 --> 00:16:47.760
Come on, mistaking the guards on duty for an enemy attack.  How dumb can you be?

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:54.020
How was I supposed to know this is the Volunteer Army headquarters?

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:57.740
I saw people with weapons wandering around at night, and I mistook them for the enemy.

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:01.910
The panicked look on your face…

00:17:02.990 --> 00:17:07.680
Rin Rin, it’s not nice to keep laughing at someone else’s mistake.

00:17:08.520 --> 00:17:10.220
You’re laughing too.

00:17:10.390 --> 00:17:13.420
I was so surprised that I peed a little on myself.

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:15.570
Huh?  What did you just say?

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:18.220
Nothing, nothing.

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:21.240
But this might be a good opportunity.

00:17:21.660 --> 00:17:25.550
This time it was a misunderstanding, caused by Bachō’s state of half sleepiness.

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:30.000
We should consider the real possibility of an enemy assault.

00:17:30.180 --> 00:17:33.930
I thought about it, that’s why I set up patrols.

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:36.720
No, that’s not enough.

00:17:36.850 --> 00:17:39.640
We need to build watchtowers in several locations around the village.

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:46.590
In an emergency, we might have to fight while confined in this palace, so we need to dig a moat and build high walls.

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:52.290
I do understand your concern, but is it really necessary to go that far?

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:53.410
Ryuubi…

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:56.780
You must be prepared for the worst and you’ll have no regrets.

00:18:09.680 --> 00:18:12.180
It looks like, they’re almost done.

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:15.690
Why do you look so glum?

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:17.080
I don’t like that person.

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:19.620
You don’t like Koumei?

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:22.300
No, him.

00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:25.390
By "him" you mean Ryuubi?

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:31.100
During the battle he always stays in the background. He never comes to the front.

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:33.840
He’s an absolute wimp of a captain.

00:18:34.190 --> 00:18:39.620
In war, if the captain is killed, everything is over.  That’s one way to fight a war.

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:42.990
Well, I don’t really like it, either.

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:49.660
And he’s keeping all the bandits' treasures we find, locked up here in a warehouse for him.

00:18:49.800 --> 00:18:55.990
He’s keeping them for war funds, not really for himself, right?

00:18:56.410 --> 00:18:59.020
Aisha said the same thing.

00:18:59.190 --> 00:19:03.360
That’s the only logical explanation.

00:19:03.400 --> 00:19:04.440
That’s enough!

00:19:06.530 --> 00:19:07.570
Hey, Chōhi!

00:19:12.890 --> 00:19:18.390
Oh boy!  The younger sister‘s jealous that her favorite sister might be taken away, huh?

00:19:25.550 --> 00:19:26.800
It’s snowing.

00:19:36.850 --> 00:19:39.560
Whoa, everything turned white.

00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:42.410
What was that for?

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:46.720
If you’re angry, come and get us.

00:19:46.860 --> 00:19:47.840
Come get us.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:52.740
I’m coming!  So you better be ready!

00:19:58.160 --> 00:20:00.560
Haha, she fell for it. She fell for it.

00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:03.340
The Volunteer Army is no big deal.

00:20:03.450 --> 00:20:04.250
No big deal.

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:09.010
This is the most embarrassing moment of my life.

00:20:12.280 --> 00:20:15.760
Geez, what a bunch of rotten brats.

00:20:15.830 --> 00:20:18.430
Really, a bunch of rotten brats, eh?

00:20:19.930 --> 00:20:21.420
What’s so funny?

00:20:21.810 --> 00:20:27.860
Well, talking about mischievous brats, reminds me of the first time I met you.

00:20:29.210 --> 00:20:32.730
“Here come the Rin Rin bandits”!

00:20:34.430 --> 00:20:37.730
The Rin Rin bandits weren’t anything like these weaklings.

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:39.540
Come on, don’t be like that.

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:45.000
Those kids probably played a trick on you because they want to be your friend.

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:49.800
I don’t understand why you have to play tricks on someone to be their friends.

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:57.480
Even if that is the case, I’m never going to be their friend!

00:20:58.110 --> 00:21:01.240
The Rin Rin Volunteer Army is coming through!

00:21:01.340 --> 00:21:02.450
Coming through.

00:21:05.930 --> 00:21:07.840
Out of my way!

00:21:10.170 --> 00:21:11.740
Hey, you brats!

00:21:12.470 --> 00:21:14.730
This is the true escape!

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:16.020
True escape!

00:21:20.150 --> 00:21:21.090
Hey, boss.

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:23.140
You should call me Captain, not boss.

00:21:23.390 --> 00:21:25.960
Captain, what should we play next?

00:21:26.340 --> 00:21:27.730
Umm…

00:21:27.770 --> 00:21:28.740
Peach blossom viewing?

00:21:28.980 --> 00:21:33.920
Dummy.  The blossoms haven’t bloomed yet.  How can we do that?

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:37.160
There’s a place in the village where you can see the peach blossoms?

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:38.370
It’s right here.  Here!

00:21:38.620 --> 00:21:44.420
There’s an amazing view when the blossoms are in full bloom.  They’ll be everywhere.

00:21:44.600 --> 00:21:48.910
That’s why the village is called Touka, which means peach blossoms.

00:21:49.010 --> 00:21:52.560
Alright then.

00:21:53.010 --> 00:21:57.180
We’ll come back and watch the blossoms when they bloom!

00:21:57.430 --> 00:21:58.990
Okay!

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:10.710
Riri, we should be leaving.

00:22:11.420 --> 00:22:12.140
Yup!

00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:15.890
Oh my, your mouth is all sticky.

00:22:16.990 --> 00:22:19.770
Here, I’ll wipe it clean for you.

00:22:22.590 --> 00:22:24.030
Yes, that will cover your bill.

00:22:24.570 --> 00:22:28.790
Sir, how much further is it to Touka village?

00:22:28.960 --> 00:22:30.310
Touka village?

00:22:30.470 --> 00:22:36.540
Ah, the Volunteer Army is stationed there, and they got rid of all the local bandits.

00:22:36.590 --> 00:22:39.110
Yes, that is right. That’s the village.

00:22:39.320 --> 00:22:44.170
You have to cross two or three more mountains from here…

00:22:44.260 --> 00:22:47.840
It would probably take you four or five days, especially with the little one in tow.

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:51.880
Are you thinking of joining the Volunteer Army?

00:22:52.050 --> 00:22:56.230
I have heard a rumor, that a person by the name of Kan’u, who helped me before…

00:22:56.350 --> 00:23:02.340
Is a commander there, so I am thinking of giving her a helping hand.

00:23:07.440 --> 00:23:08.320
Sir?

00:23:08.870 --> 00:23:10.260
Yes, what is it?

00:23:10.470 --> 00:23:15.270
Can you give me the details about the Volunteer Army at Touka village?

00:23:29.180 --> 00:23:34.160
<i>I am the heroine of this world, no matter what.</i>

00:23:34.280 --> 00:23:39.210
<i>Such a splendid world,
no questions asked, because I said so.</i>

00:23:40.690 --> 00:23:45.030
<i>Anywhere I am, it always turns into paradise.</i>

00:23:45.830 --> 00:23:49.620
<i>Every season, mellow and carefree.
Today and tomorrow, always an adventure.</i>

00:23:49.790 --> 00:23:54.600
<i>I run away when times are tough.
But get involved when easy and fun.</i>

00:23:54.770 --> 00:23:59.950
<i>If I stress, I just stop and smell the roses.  If there's a great opportunity, I go for it!</i>

00:23:59.990 --> 00:24:04.960
<i>There are so many things that I want.</i>

00:24:05.090 --> 00:24:12.590
<i>I am so brave, that I can take on the invincible.</i>

00:24:12.800 --> 00:24:17.780
<i>After all said and done, I am the heroine of this world.</i>

00:24:17.950 --> 00:24:23.000
<i>The world revolves around me.  I am the center of the world!</i>

00:24:23.090 --> 00:24:28.060
<i>I am the heroine of this world, no matter what.</i>

00:24:28.230 --> 00:24:33.200
<i>Such a splendid world,
no questions asked, because I said so.</i>

00:24:43.230 --> 00:24:50.190
Cutie-cute
